# Very common daily verbs. :V adds every form of the stem.

# کہنا (the bare stem is written کہہ, so these are by hand)
@w 94
کہہ = keh kah kh~
کہا = kaha keha kahaa
کہی = kahi kehi khi~
کہے = kahe kahay kehe khay~
